### `server/prisma/schema.prisma` (model Vehicle only)

```prisma
// A customer's vehicle. Belongs to one CRM contact; make, model, year and tyre size 1 are required (shown as its name,
// e.g. "Toyota Land Cruiser 2022"); the plate number is optional.
// lastServiceDate is no longer on the form but kept (existing data); editing a vehicle leaves it as it is.
// Audit: who added / last changed / deleted it and when (user ids); deleting sets deletedAt/deletedBy (soft delete).
model Vehicle {
  id               String    @id @default(cuid())
  workspaceId      String
  contactId        String
  plateNumber      String?   @db.VarChar(20)
  make             String    @db.VarChar(60)
  model            String    @db.VarChar(60)
  year             Int
  registrationDate DateTime? @db.Date
  lastServiceDate  DateTime? @db.Date
  tireSize1        String    @db.VarChar(30)
  tireSize2        String?   @db.VarChar(30)
  // Free-text notes about this vehicle (team only)
  remarks          String?   @db.Text
  createdAt        DateTime  @default(now())
  createdBy        String?
  updatedAt        DateTime  @default(now()) @updatedAt
  updatedBy        String?
  deletedAt        DateTime?
  deletedBy        String?
  contact          Contact   @relation(fields: [contactId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  workspace        Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([contactId, createdAt])
  @@index([workspaceId])
}
```

